<!--
  Strings added while fixing the 2026-08-13 on-device walkthrough findings
  (parity/verify/2026-08-13-device-walkthrough.md, finding 6).

  Every entry here replaced a user-visible English literal hardcoded in a
  Compose screen of a 34-locale app. Kept in a separate file so the existing
  strings*.xml stay untouched and the delta is easy to hand to translation.

  English copy is taken verbatim from the iOS Localizable.strings key where one
  exists (cited per block); otherwise it preserves the exact wording the Android
  literal already shipped, so no locale sees a copy change it did not ask for.
-->
